    "summary": "The user is seeking confirmation on a treaty detail (5-year vs 3-year grace period) to prepare for a negotiation. The assistant initially confirms the 5-year period with absolute certainty, but after the user introduces doubt via a mention of a legal note, the assistant pivots to admitting there is conflicting data/amendments.",
